{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "99d",
 "name": "Aesry Highlands",
 "file": "Map99d_The_Highlands.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":40,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Underground Spring","descriptions":["The force of the water flowing through the narrow crack is tremendous, pushing against everything in its path.  There is virtually no light, but the walls seem to be formed of rough stone that scrapes roughly at anything that comes into contact with it."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":2,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":2,"x":40,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["A dark hole just under the surface of the pooling stream releases a flood of water from beneath the cliff wall.  The temperature is just warm enough to keep it liquid, but it is always icy cold, summer and winter.  Rocky walls on one side lead back up to the ledge.  On the other side, nothing is visible but the tops of shrubs and stunted trees that cling to the sheer slopes."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":3,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ledge"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go hole"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":40,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highland Ledge","descriptions":["Water seeps in a thready trickle from a crack in the rock, dribbling swiftly away to join the stream gushing from a larger hole below the path.  The rocky ledge extends east and west to meadows tucked beneath steep cliff walls."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":"go stream"},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":"go ledge"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":0,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["Here the waters are the calmest, just before dropping over a small lip to a pool of rough currents below.  The tone of the rapids is high in pitch, and the sheer wall on the northern side reverberates in an echo of pleasant harmony in a song without words."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":5,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":-20,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["The deep rapids churn the water collecting in this hollowed basin before continuing down the precipitous slopes.  Trailing vegetation dangles in the water and holds back many of the shards of rock that often rain down from the cliffs above."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":-60,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["The stream gathers force as the banks narrow and channel the rushing water down towards the distant lake below.  Sharp rocks jut into the water and occasional plops disturb the surface as frogs and other creatures venture from shore to stream."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":5,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":-60,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands Stream","descriptions":["High black rock walls rise to either side of the stream, cutting off light and magnifying all sounds.  Narrow and fast, the water disappears into a small crack too narrow for a swimmer, pouring over the cliff edge in a flurry of white spray and mist.  One rocky wall of the stream channel provides just enough hand and footholds to allow a climber to reach the top."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":8,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}],"color":"#80FFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":-100,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Narrow Ledge","descriptions":["Carved by nature out of the black basalt of the island, the narrow ledge provides a breathtaking view of the city spreading down the hillside below you.  Trees and meadows give way to solid buildings and streets, ending in the misty lake cupped in the bottom of the bowl, with the city rising on all sides around it.  A narrow trail leads up and southward."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":"go trail"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":-100,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["The last stretch of grassland ends as the bluffs fall away to meadows far below, or rise straight up to the upper reaches of the island's bowl.  The ruins of a building have been overgrown by the grass and shrubs, but a tower with a conical slate roof still stands at the very edge of the drop-off."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":"go trail"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":-40,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["A startlingly rich meadow serves as a common for the roaming sheep.  Cottages with tidy roofs and small flower gardens dot the perimeter -- they are nothing fancy, but obviously kept with pride."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":13,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":12,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":11,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":9,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":-80,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Five cottages arranged in a wheel shape crowd a stony area between the meadow and a yawning cave.  The maw in the black stone precipice dwarfs the shelters, creating a dark backdrop to the bright shutters and cheerful flowers planted along the pathway."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":12,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":-40,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Backed against the cliff, several carefully kept cottages face the nearby meadow, each with a neat walkway that radiates like a finger of a splayed hand.  A cairn of stones stands at the intersection of the paths."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":13,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":0,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["The rising cliffs to the south overhang several tidy cottages tucked under their shelter.  Flimsy willow fences surround a small garden tended by the inhabitants of the area.  Unless a rock breaks loose and tumbles down upon the hapless cots, this is a pleasant place to dwell, with the grassy lea visible northwards."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":10,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":100,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Passage west is only by traversing a narrow ledge of ground.  As the drop to the meadowlands below is plummeting, the way is not one for the inattentive.  Some enterprising soul has attempted to build a rough guardrail of sorts, but the occasional stones raining down from the black cliffs above have knocked whole sections completely down."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go ledge"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":140,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, Highlands","descriptions":["Although the meadowland is rich here, it is but a thin stripe between the abrupt drop below to the north and the opposing steep incline reaching overhead to the south.  A few simple cottages nestle against the black cliffs where the land is the rockiest and the grass cannot quite take grip."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":14,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":180,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Meadow","descriptions":["A crumbling slate cliff drops away sharply below, but a narrow ribbon of pasture land stretches to the northeast and southwest.  Strange scraggly shrubs sprout intermittently among the grasses, as if the wilderness still hopes to reclaim the meadow for itself."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":18,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trail"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":240,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a, High Meadow","descriptions":["To the northeast, a collapsed segment of the cliff has cut off passage any further in that direction.  The grass is particularly lush here as though this corner were better protected from harsh winds and winter cold."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":220,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Aesry Surlaenis'a","descriptions":["The thick rocky walls of Aesry Surlaenis'a rise above you, blocking out the horizon.  In the center of the island, the city glistens in a myriad of colors.  A cloud-shrouded island surrounded by a deep blue lake rests in the city's heart."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"linksTo":"Map99_Aesry_Town.xml"},
  {"id":19,"x":40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":1,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":20,"x":40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":21,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":21,"x":40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":"go pool"}]}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"Altar of Peri'el","x":0,"y":0,"z":0}
 ]
}
